
                       geant4-11-04-ref-03
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Use smart pointer and C++11 static semantics to implement G4Cache backing
   store.
 o Improved performance of GetCollectionID() in G4SDManager and G4HCTable by
   avoiding unneeded memory allocations.
 o Removed G4UserSpecialCuts process from G4StepLimiterPhysics.
 
---------- Reference-tag 'Release Notes' -----------

(o)  Fixes included in patch release 11.4.1
(*)  Fixes included in patch release 11.4.2

Summarised, the list of changes is the following:

digits_hits/detector                             det-V11-04-01
--------------------
- Improved performance of GetCollectionID() in G4SDManager and G4HCTable by  (*)
  avoiding unneeded memory allocations; further improve it by adding a second
  interface, avoiding the need to concatenate strings together and then take
  them apart again.

geometry/management                              geommng-V11-04-00
-------------------
- In G4VoxelisationHelper, moved checks printouts in method                  (*)
