global                                           global-V11-04-07
------
- Use smart pointer and C++11 static semantics to implement G4Cache backing
  store.
- Always initialize G4CacheReference for a G4Cache instance on construction  (o)
  of latter. Prevents fatal G4Exception when only low ID G4Cache elements are
  accessed.
- Updated date and tag-ID for geant4-11-04-ref-03.

